<form class="totalform help-on-hover help-box" data-method="POST" data-route="/admin/settings/i18n"><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: default;" data-settings="{&quot;propertyOptions&quot;:&quot;locales&quot;}"><label for="field-UID">Default Locale</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="default" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value class="placeholder" disabled>Select default locale</option><option value="af_ZA">Afrikaans [af_ZA]</option><option value="id_ID">Bahasa Indonesia [id_ID]</option><option value="ms_MY">Bahasa Melayu [ms_MY]</option><option value="jv_ID">Basa Jawa [jv_ID]</option><option value="da_DK">Dansk [da_DK]</option><option value="de_AT">Deutsch (AT) [de_AT]</option><option value="de_CH">Deutsch (CH) [de_CH]</option><option value="de_DE">Deutsch (DE) [de_DE]</option><option value="de">Deutsch [de]</option><option value="et_EE">Eesti [et_EE]</option><option value="en_AU">English (AU) [en_AU]</option><option value="en_CA">English (CA) [en_CA]</option><option value="en_GB">English (GB) [en_GB]</option><option value="en_SG">English (SG) [en_SG]</option><option value="en_US" selected>English (US) [en_US]</option><option value="en">English [en]</option><option value="es_ES">Español (ES) [es_ES]</option><option value="es_MX">Español (MX) [es_MX]</option><option value="es">Español [es]</option><option value="fr_CA">Français (CA) [fr_CA]</option><option value="fr_FR">Français (FR) [fr_FR]</option><option value="fr">Français [fr]</option><option value="ga_IE">Gaeilge [ga_IE]</option><option value="hr_HR">Hrvatski [hr_HR]</option><option value="it_IT">Italiano [it_IT]</option><option value="sw_KE">Kiswahili [sw_KE]</option><option value="lv_LV">Latviešu [lv_LV]</option><option value="lt_LT">Lietuvių [lt_LT]</option><option value="hu_HU">Magyar [hu_HU]</option><option value="mt_MT">Malti [mt_MT]</option><option value="nl_NL">Nederlands [nl_NL]</option><option value="no_NO">Norsk [no_NO]</option><option value="pl_PL">Polski [pl_PL]</option><option value="pt_BR">Português (BR) [pt_BR]</option><option value="pt_PT">Português (PT) [pt_PT]</option><option value="pt">Português [pt]</option><option value="ro_RO">Română [ro_RO]</option><option value="sk_SK">Slovenčina [sk_SK]</option><option value="sl_SI">Slovenščina [sl_SI]</option><option value="sr_Latn_RS">Srpski (Latn) [sr_Latn_RS]</option><option value="fi_FI">Suomi [fi_FI]</option><option value="sv_SE">Svenska [sv_SE]</option><option value="tl_PH">Tagalog [tl_PH]</option><option value="vi_VN">Tiếng Việt [vi_VN]</option><option value="tr_TR">Türkçe [tr_TR]</option><option value="cs_CZ">Čeština [cs_CZ]</option><option value="el_GR">Ελληνικά [el_GR]</option><option value="bg_BG">Български [bg_BG]</option><option value="ru_RU">Русский [ru_RU]</option><option value="sr_Cyrl_RS">Српски (Ћирилица) [sr_Cyrl_RS]</option><option value="uk_UA">Українська [uk_UA]</option><option value="he_IL">עברית [he_IL]</option><option value="ur_PK">اردو [ur_PK]</option><option value="ar_SA">العربية (SA) [ar_SA]</option><option value="ar">العربية [ar]</option><option value="fa_IR">فارسی [fa_IR]</option><option value="hi_IN">हिन्दी [hi_IN]</option><option value="bn_BD">বাংলা [bn_BD]</option><option value="pa_IN">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ [pa_IN]</option><option value="ta_IN">தமிழ் [ta_IN]</option><option value="th_TH">ไทย [th_TH]</option><option value="km_KH">ខ្មែរ [km_KH]</option><option value="zh_CN">中文 (CN) [zh_CN]</option><option value="zh_TW">中文 (TW) [zh_TW]</option><option value="ja_JP">日本語 [ja_JP]</option><option value="ko_KR">한국어 [ko_KR]</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The single canonical locale for this site. Drives date / number / currency formatting (PHP intl, CakePHP I18n, Faker), the admin UI translation language, and — for Pro sites using localized content fields — the default tab on render plus the fallback when a template requests a locale that has no content. Should be one of the available locales below when content localization is in use.</p></div><div class="form-field list-field " data-type="list" style="--grid-area: available;" data-settings="{&quot;propertyOptions&quot;:&quot;locales&quot;}"><label for="field-UID">Available Content Locales</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="available" multiple size="1" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value="af_ZA">Afrikaans [af_ZA]</option><option value="id_ID">Bahasa Indonesia [id_ID]</option><option value="ms_MY">Bahasa Melayu [ms_MY]</option><option value="jv_ID">Basa Jawa [jv_ID]</option><option value="da_DK">Dansk [da_DK]</option><option value="de_AT">Deutsch (AT) [de_AT]</option><option value="de_CH">Deutsch (CH) [de_CH]</option><option value="de_DE">Deutsch (DE) [de_DE]</option><option value="de">Deutsch [de]</option><option value="et_EE">Eesti [et_EE]</option><option value="en_AU">English (AU) [en_AU]</option><option value="en_CA">English (CA) [en_CA]</option><option value="en_GB">English (GB) [en_GB]</option><option value="en_SG">English (SG) [en_SG]</option><option value="en_US">English (US) [en_US]</option><option value="en">English [en]</option><option value="es_ES">Español (ES) [es_ES]</option><option value="es_MX">Español (MX) [es_MX]</option><option value="es">Español [es]</option><option value="fr_CA">Français (CA) [fr_CA]</option><option value="fr_FR">Français (FR) [fr_FR]</option><option value="fr">Français [fr]</option><option value="ga_IE">Gaeilge [ga_IE]</option><option value="hr_HR">Hrvatski [hr_HR]</option><option value="it_IT">Italiano [it_IT]</option><option value="sw_KE">Kiswahili [sw_KE]</option><option value="lv_LV">Latviešu [lv_LV]</option><option value="lt_LT">Lietuvių [lt_LT]</option><option value="hu_HU">Magyar [hu_HU]</option><option value="mt_MT">Malti [mt_MT]</option><option value="nl_NL">Nederlands [nl_NL]</option><option value="no_NO">Norsk [no_NO]</option><option value="pl_PL">Polski [pl_PL]</option><option value="pt_BR">Português (BR) [pt_BR]</option><option value="pt_PT">Português (PT) [pt_PT]</option><option value="pt">Português [pt]</option><option value="ro_RO">Română [ro_RO]</option><option value="sk_SK">Slovenčina [sk_SK]</option><option value="sl_SI">Slovenščina [sl_SI]</option><option value="sr_Latn_RS">Srpski (Latn) [sr_Latn_RS]</option><option value="fi_FI">Suomi [fi_FI]</option><option value="sv_SE">Svenska [sv_SE]</option><option value="tl_PH">Tagalog [tl_PH]</option><option value="vi_VN">Tiếng Việt [vi_VN]</option><option value="tr_TR">Türkçe [tr_TR]</option><option value="cs_CZ">Čeština [cs_CZ]</option><option value="el_GR">Ελληνικά [el_GR]</option><option value="bg_BG">Български [bg_BG]</option><option value="ru_RU">Русский [ru_RU]</option><option value="sr_Cyrl_RS">Српски (Ћирилица) [sr_Cyrl_RS]</option><option value="uk_UA">Українська [uk_UA]</option><option value="he_IL">עברית [he_IL]</option><option value="ur_PK">اردو [ur_PK]</option><option value="ar_SA">العربية (SA) [ar_SA]</option><option value="ar">العربية [ar]</option><option value="fa_IR">فارسی [fa_IR]</option><option value="hi_IN">हिन्दी [hi_IN]</option><option value="bn_BD">বাংলা [bn_BD]</option><option value="pa_IN">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ [pa_IN]</option><option value="ta_IN">தமிழ் [ta_IN]</option><option value="th_TH">ไทย [th_TH]</option><option value="km_KH">ខ្មែរ [km_KH]</option><option value="zh_CN">中文 (CN) [zh_CN]</option><option value="zh_TW">中文 (TW) [zh_TW]</option><option value="ja_JP">日本語 [ja_JP]</option><option value="ko_KR">한국어 [ko_KR]</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Pro: locale codes available for `localizedtext` and `localizedstyledtext` fields. Each code expands into a tab in the admin editor. <strong>Order matters:</strong> when a template asks for a bare language code like `en` and the data has both `en_US` and `en_GB`, the helper returns the first matching entry in this list. Pick from the autocomplete to ensure the label and direction (LTR/RTL) come from the registry.</p></div><div class="form-inline-fields"><button type="submit" class="button btn cms-save cms-button">Save Settings</button></div></form>